import ../../../ui/source_language.dl

to get [an editor reply containing] {string:text}:
    return a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON number "id" is 12, JSON child "result" is (a new JSON-RPC text for text)]]

set document to a UI source document named "main.dl" at "file:///workspace/main.dl" prefixed by "import base.dl\n\n" containing "print \"😀\"" using UI CPU analysis
set client to a UI language client rooted at "file:///workspace"
# A completed analysis is the starting point; source_language covers initialization.
set client's phase to 7
set client's document to document
set client's uri to document's uri
set client's context to document's context
set client's profiles to the compact JSON form of (document's profiles)
set client's snapshot to document's prefix + document's source
set client's revision to document's revision
set client's version to 1
set document's analyzed revision to document's revision

set query to request UI source feature "textDocument/completion" at byte 12 in document
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing document at 0.0 seconds
require condition (work's step = 12) reporting "An unchanged document could not request completion."
set message to the JSON member named "message" in (work's payload)
require condition ((the JSON text named "method" in message) = "textDocument/completion") reporting "The wrong source feature was requested."
set parameters to the JSON member named "params" in message
set position to the JSON member named "position" in parameters
require condition (((the JSON number named "line" in position) = 2.0) and ((the JSON number named "character" in position) = 10.0)) reporting "Feature requests did not share prefix and Unicode coordinates."
free work's payload

# A newer cursor request supersedes the in-flight answer without losing its work.
set same to request UI source feature "textDocument/completion" at byte 0 in document
require condition (same = query) reporting "Feature slots grew for every cursor position."
set response to an editor reply containing "old position"
set work to the UI language reply response at step 12 in client
free response
require condition ((query's ready = false) and (query's queued)) reporting "A superseded cursor result became visible or discarded newer work."
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing document at 0.0 seconds
require condition (work's step = 12) reporting "The replacement query was not sent."
free work's payload
set response to an editor reply containing "current position"
set work to the UI language reply response at step 12 in client
free response
require condition ((query's ready) and (query's result's text = "current position")) reporting "A feature result was not retained independently of its transport reply."

cancel UI source query query
require condition (query's ready = false) reporting "Cancelling a feature retained its presentation."
set {saved completion} to query
set hover to request UI source feature "textDocument/hover" at byte 0 in document
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing document at 0.0 seconds
free work's payload
edit UI source document document to (the string form of "new text") at 1.0 seconds
require condition ((document's queries = hover) and (hover's next = {saved completion})) reporting "Cancelling queries while editing discarded their owned slots."
set response to an editor reply containing "old source"
set work to the UI language reply response at step 12 in client
free response
require condition (hover's ready = false) reporting "A result for preceding source became visible."

# Interactive requests synchronize edits immediately instead of waiting for debounce.
set query to request UI source feature "textDocument/completion" at byte 8 in document
require condition (query = {saved completion}) reporting "Editing allocated another slot for an existing source feature."
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing document at 1.0 seconds
require condition (work's step = 5) reporting "A feature request ran before its source was synchronized."
free work's payload
set response to a new JSON-RPC array
set work to the UI language reply response at step 5 in client
free response
free work's payload
set response to a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON number "id" is 6, JSON child "result" is (a JSON object containing [JSON child "data" is (a new JSON-RPC array)])]]
set work to the UI language reply response at step 6 in client
free response
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing document at 1.0 seconds
require condition (work's step = 12) reporting "The synchronized feature request was lost."
free work's payload
cancel UI source query query
set response to an editor reply containing "cancelled"
set work to the UI language reply response at step 12 in client
free response
require condition ((query's ready = false) and (query's queued = false)) reporting "A cancelled in-flight result became visible."

# A method's newer slot can change from notification to request while its old
# notification is in flight. The reply still follows the dispatched message.
set parameters to a new JSON-RPC object
set query to notify UI source feature "example/feature" with parameters parameters in document
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing document at 1.0 seconds
free work's payload
set query to request UI source feature "example/feature" with parameters parameters in document
free parameters
set response to a new JSON-RPC array
set work to the UI language reply response at step 12 in client
free response
require condition ((query's queued) and (query's ready = false)) reporting "A notification reply answered its replacement request."
set work to the next UI language work for client analyzing document at 1.0 seconds
free work's payload
set response to an editor reply containing "request result"
set work to the UI language reply response at step 12 in client
free response
require condition ((query's ready) and (query's result's text = "request result")) reporting "A request reused its preceding notification's reply policy."

# Context changes invalidate queued requests even when visible text is unchanged.
set query to request UI source feature "textDocument/definition" at byte 0 in document
set {saved queries} to document's queries
set files to a new JSON-RPC object
configure UI source document document named "renamed.dl" at "file:///workspace/renamed.dl" prefixed by "" using UI CPU analysis with files files
free files
require condition (document's queries = {saved queries}) reporting "Reconfiguring source context discarded its owned query slots."
require condition ((document has pending UI source queries) = false) reporting "A query retained an obsolete project context."
require condition (query's queued = false) reporting "An obsolete query stayed in the work queue."
free UI language client client
free UI source document document
print line "Source features share Unicode coordinates, synchronization, cancellation and stale-result isolation."
